      "created_at": "2015-03-23T16:18:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Isn't there a thing in Tactics which is different than in SotM that things which happen after an event are not subject to that event? &nbsp;So, in SotM, if something comes out with an end-of-turn effect, it goes on the stack to be handled during the current end-of-turn. &nbsp;But Tactics ins't like that, so why would the new Proletariat be subject to the attack?</p>",
