      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You have 3 actions, you use your first to move. &nbsp;I have yet to have a good prole match without Beacon, so maybe it isn't the best, but sharing the burden goes wrong too much for my tastes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Move</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Overwhelm -&gt; Move</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hammer</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If I were picking Pro in a tournament, you can bet Beacon would be my first pick. AbZero second maybe (structures can force your opponent to come to you to get LoS). I like that team a lot.</p>",
